{
  "dom_id": "step-29747",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Identifying True Statements Regarding a Function's Local Extrema",
  "problem": "Let $f(x)$ be the function shown below. Which of the following statements are true? \n\nI. $f(x)$ attains a local maximum at $x=-2$\n\nII. $f(x)$ attains a local minimum at $x=2$\n\nIII. $f(x)$ attains a local maximum at $x=0$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14227500/assets/9b933b1b869b74f2a7340f9ba4034b970c49434d12592d3ff1e152057b6adef1.png)",
  "worked_solution": "Let's examine each of the given statements in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. The function has a local minimum at $x=-2.$ For example, in the interval $(-2.5,-1.5),$ the smallest value of the function is attained at $x=-2,$ as shown below. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14227500/assets/3abb7470db51fa1bdb61e15aec1739de44bf5083b7341b90a65ac93fc7f8adbb.png)\n\nWe can write this mathematically as $f(x) \\ge f(-2) \\:$ for all $\\: x \\in (-2.5,-1.5).$\n\n- Statement II is true. The function has a local minimum at $x=2.$ For example, in the interval $(1.5,2.5),$ the smallest value of the function is attained at $x=2,$ as shown below. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14227500/assets/71c6e7af0a1de77543b57d2aee242fe84295ad46c748b2f65f7cba381c47b80c.png)\n\nWe can write this mathematically as $f(x) \\ge f(2) \\:$ for all $\\: x \\in (1.5,2.5).$\n\n- Statement III is true. The function has a local maximum at $x=0.$ For example, in the interval $(-0.5,0.5),$ the greatest value of the function is attained at $x=0,$ as shown below. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14227500/assets/83de300c3e00766d46989d12b4e1708ef9a73f4d02748009a526b1646d7f0b81.png)\n\nWe can write this mathematically as $f(x) \\le f(0) \\:$ for all $\\: x \\in (-0.5,0.5).$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-29747\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"29747\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"7971\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-29747\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-10\">Identifying True Statements Regarding a Function's Local Extrema</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"29747\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n  